# No production until asked

Never push git remotes, never `vercel deploy --prod`, never run `deploy-api-vercel.mjs` / `vercel-push-web-env.mjs`, and never change production env unless the user explicitly asks to ship, deploy, or push production.

Local `npm run dev` is fine.
